  "content": "<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3metZ7E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"1000\"></p><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1037808?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcGPE3mktFe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1141743994154528768?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;label=MineColonies: Dimesnional Adventure&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"26\"></a><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/d72EAPUQ?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Tinted Sands&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\"></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>我的其他專案</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/852146?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"28\"></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1098989?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=MineColonies: Block Party&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/wdfIaSqz?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=MineColonies: Block Party&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"254\" height=\"26\"></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/979514?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=Cloche Creations&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"223\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mbekts9X?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Cloche Creations&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/985671?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=Tinted Grass&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ZwO3amOU?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Tinted Grass&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/994223?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=Tinted Torches&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mc1hqaaO?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Tinted Torches&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1009078?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=Tinted Dyes&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/77VVvOOe?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Tinted Dyes&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"28\"></strong></em></span></p><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1164785?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Curseforge&amp;label=Tinted Planks&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/rDPwULcT?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;label=Tinted Planks&amp;color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\"></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>此模組需要 Tinted Dyes</strong></em></span></p><p>你是否曾想過 Minecraft 的沙漠可以再多一點……個性？</p><p>如果你回答「是」，那麼你完全正確。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在此為你獻上「染色沙礫」。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>「染色沙礫」是一個讓玩家能將沙塊染成不同顏色的模組。</p><p>本模組目前為以下方塊提供了 75 種美妙的色彩選擇：</p><p>沙</p><p>砂岩</p><p>兩種雕紋砂岩（一種有苦力怕臉，另一種圖案我不確定叫什麼）</p><p>切製砂岩</p><p>平滑砂岩</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>免責聲明</em> 本模組主要用於裝飾目的。請隨心使用，盡情發揮你的建築創意！</p>",
